{"text": "Installation STEP 3 Connect the water hose The provided water hose may differ depending on the model. Please follow the instruction according to the provided water hose. Connecting to a threaded water tap (applicable models only) 1. Connect the water hose to the water tap, and then turn the connector clockwise as shown. 2. Connect the other end of the water hose to the inlet valve on the back of the washing machine. Turn the hose clockwise to tighten. 3. Open the water tap and check if there are any leaks around the connection areas. If there are water leaks, repeat the steps above. WARNING If there is a water leak, stop operating the washing machine and disconnect from the electrical supply. Then, contact a local Samsung service centre in case of a leak from the water hose, or contact a plumbing technician in case of a leak from the water tap. Otherwise, this may cause electric shock. 12 English UUnnttiittlleedd--1111 1122 22002266--0044--0088 (cid:31)(cid:31)(cid:31)(cid:31) 22::4466::4411", "source": "D:\\Study\\4_Forth Semester\\AI\\project\\MultiAgent_RAG\\data\\Top-Load Washer Ecobubble 9Kg user_manual.pdf", "page": 11}